Description: libLLVM.dylib for LLVM 19
 Shared LLVM library under /var/jb/usr/lib/llvm-19/lib (libLLVM.dylib and
 libLLVM-19.dylib). Coexists with Procursus libllvm16; do not remove libllvm16
 while swift-5.9.2 is installed.
